OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to anglers after swans
OL,4,Ainjured by tackle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife rescue has urged anglers to
OL,7,Fbe careful while fishing in canals
OL,8,Fafter a cygnet died and several others
OL,9,Fwere injured by fishing gear.
OL,11,FGlenn Slaney, of Warsop Wildlife Rescue
OL,12,FTeam (WWRT), said there had been a
OL,13,Flarge increase in call-outs to injured
OL,14,Fbirds compared with last year along the
OL,15,FChesterfield Canal in Worksop,
OL,16,FNottinghamshire.
OL,18,FFifteen call-outs were to the same
OL,19,Ffamily of swans, he said, and various
OL,20,Finjuries were from fishing line, hooks
OL,21,Fand nets.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
