OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to anglers after swans
OL,4,Ainjured by tackle
OL,5,
OL,6,FSlaney said: "We just urge anybody that
OL,7,Fwould like to go fishing to just be a
OL,8,Flittle bit respectful of your
OL,9,Fsurroundings because a lot of the
OL,10,Fissues that we face specifically with
OL,11,Ffishing lures etc, they can be
OL,12,Favoided."
